                    <h1 class="content-title">Developer Patterns & <span class="gradient-text">APIs</span></h1>
                    <p class="content-subtitle">
                        Practical guidance for developers working with IRM — common API patterns, scripted 
                        indicator recipes, Flow Designer configurations, and the pitfalls to avoid.
                    </p>
